  "description": "Born from a family where daughters don’t survive until adulthood, frail Frida Harkbourne enters a political marriage with the feared war hero Duke Daniel Richards. Abandoned at the altar and left with a comatose husband, Frida gains unexpected freedom and quietly rebuilds his barren territory. Three years later, Daniel awakens to find a gentle, determined duchess who has transformed his lands through sheer will. As imperial intrigue, hidden enemies, and looming succession conflicts close in, a wary duke and a dying duchess begin a tense partnership that could change their lives… if only Frida can live long enough for it.\n\n**Original Novel:**    \nChapters: [Naver Novel](https://novel.naver.com/webnovel/list.nhn?novelId=987039), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6312285)    \nVolumes: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11116827) \n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13919561) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/the-duchess-lives-only-for-this-day), [Japanese](https://mechacomic.jp/books/265592)",
